{"version":2,"width":100,"height":30,"timestamp":1793906822,"idle_time_limit":2.0,"command":"bash examples/github-leak-demo/run.sh","env":{"SHELL":"/bin/zsh"}}
[0.011849, "o", "building (first run takes a while)...\r\n"]
[1.096046, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1m== Setup\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[1.096054, "o", "\u001b[2m# attenuo at http://127.0.0.1:58224 proxies a fake GitHub MCP server at port 58225 as 'github'.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[1.096084, "o", "\u001b[2m# Policy: read_file only when repo like \"alice/public-*\"; create_issue there only after an approval. See policy.cedar.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[1.096086, "o", "\u001b[2m# The policy has its own tests (policy_test.yaml). They run offline, before any server traffic.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[1.09612, "o", "$ attenuo policy test examples/github-leak-demo/policy_test.yaml\r\n"]
[1.821643, "o", "examples/github-leak-demo/policy_test.yaml\r\n  ✓ coder may read a public repo  (allow: policy_allow [read_file_public_repos_only])\r\n  ✓ the injected read of a private repo is denied  (deny: policy_deny)\r\n  ✓ read_file without a repo argument is denied  (deny: policy_deny)\r\n  ✓ create_issue is denied by capability when coder was only given read_file  (deny: capability_denied)\r\n  ✓ the assistant's own create_issue in a public repo waits for an approval  (deny: approval_required [ask_before_create_issue])\r\n  ✓ once approved, the identical create_issue is allowed  (allow: policy_allow [create_issue_public_repos])\r\n  ✓ create_issue in a private repo gets no permit, approved or not  (deny: policy_deny)\r\n  ✓ delete_repo without MFA is denied by the forbid  (deny: policy_deny [forbid_sensitive_without_mfa])\r\n  ✓ delete_repo with MFA is still denied, because nothing permits it  (deny: policy_deny)\r\n"]
[1.821647, "o", "  ✓ a four-agent chain is forbidden even for a public read  (deny: policy_deny [forbid_deep_chains])\r\n  ✓ a three-agent chain is fine  (allow: policy_allow [read_file_public_repos_only])\r\n\r\n11 passed, 0 failed (11 cases in 1 file)\r\nall 5 policies exercised\r\n"]
[1.821843, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1m== 1. Alice's assistant gets a broad token (any github tool), like the over-privileged PAT\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[1.821864, "o", "$ attenuo token root --subject alice --agent assistant --cap \"github:*\"\r\n"]
[1.834183, "o", "lease       d008b924-8311-499e-a2a5-d4ee52a749e3\r\nexpires_in  900s\r\n"]
[1.834238, "o", "token       eyJ0eXAiOiJhdHRlbnVvK2p3...\r\n"]
[1.839616, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1m== 2. The assistant hands its 'coder' sub-agent read_file and nothing else\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[1.83962, "o", "\u001b[2m# The coder authenticates as itself ([[agents]] in config.toml): only it can receive a token in its name.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[1.839643, "o", "\u001b[2m# Its secret goes in on stdin (or ATTENUO_CLIENT_SECRET, or --client-secret-file), never in argv;\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[1.839645, "o", "\u001b[2m# so do the tokens (ATTENUO_TOKEN, --token-file or --token -).\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[1.839675, "o", "$ printf \"%s\\n\" demo-coder-secret | ATTENUO_TOKEN=\"$ROOT_TOKEN\" attenuo token exchange --actor coder --client-secret-stdin --cap github:read_file\r\n"]
[1.853377, "o", "lease       26c9557b-1cd9-4583-b16b-49239d66169b\r\nexpires_in  899s\r\n"]
[1.853449, "o", "token       eyJ0eXAiOiJhdHRlbnVvK2p3...\r\n"]
[1.858753, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1m== 3. What the coder's token says\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[1.858759, "o", "$ attenuo token inspect \"$CODER\" --verify\r\n"]
[1.867855, "o", "user alice  (issuer https://idp.example)\r\n  authenticated 2026-11-05T19:27:04Z\r\n└─ agent assistant\r\n     can   github:*\r\n     until 2026-11-05T19:42:04Z (in 14m 59s)\r\n     lease d008b924-8311-499e-a2a5-d4ee52a749e3\r\n   └─ agent coder  <- holds this token\r\n        can   github:read_file\r\n        until 2026-11-05T19:42:04Z (in 14m 59s)\r\n        lease 26c9557b-1cd9-4583-b16b-49239d66169b\r\n\r\n"]
[1.86786, "o", "iss http://127.0.0.1:58224   aud attenuo   jti c3b85837-7520-42fc-ab95-517a87010e09\r\nkid LjQQETg_Ns_reAhRV7DPrQ   ou_kid LjQQETg_Ns_reAhRV7DPrQ\r\nexp 2026-11-05T19:42:04Z (in 14m 59s)\r\nmay_act (absent): any authenticated agent may exchange this token\r\nverified: signature, type, issuer, audience, expiry, chain\r\n"]
[1.868058, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1m== 4. The coder reads a public repo as intended: allowed\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[1.868083, "o", "$ ATTENUO_TOKEN=\"$CODER\" attenuo call --server github --tool read_file --arg repo=alice/public-docs --arg path=README.md\r\n"]
[1.880861, "o", "ALLOWED\r\n{\"arguments\":{\"path\":\"README.md\",\"repo\":\"alice/public-docs\"},\"name\":\"read_file\"}\r\n"]
[1.881025, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1m== 5. A malicious issue tells the coder to read alice/private-salaries: denied by policy\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[1.881037, "o", "\u001b[2m# read_file is in the token, but the policy only lets it touch alice/public-*.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[1.881056, "o", "$ ATTENUO_TOKEN=\"$CODER\" attenuo call --server github --tool read_file --arg repo=alice/private-salaries --arg path=2025.csv\r\n"]
[1.889794, "o", "DENIED  policy_deny\r\ndecision 90c719e5-338c-4435-b418-722a4b5d64c5\r\n"]
[1.889976, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1m== 6. The injection tries to copy the data out through create_issue: denied, never delegated\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[1.889998, "o", "$ ATTENUO_TOKEN=\"$CODER\" attenuo call --server github --tool create_issue --arg repo=alice/public-docs --arg title=leak\r\n"]
[1.898681, "o", "DENIED  capability_denied\r\ndecision 10fd48a8-f559-4b52-a212-89dba8f02d0a\r\n"]
[1.898852, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1m== 7. Alice sees the session going wrong and revokes the assistant's lease\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[1.898872, "o", "$ attenuo lease revoke \"$ROOT_LEASE\" --reason \"agent session compromised\"\r\n"]
[1.907297, "o", "revoked 2 lease(s) starting at d008b924-8311-499e-a2a5-d4ee52a749e3 (reason: agent session compromised)\r\n"]
[1.907476, "o", "$ attenuo lease show \"$CODER_LEASE\"\r\n"]
[1.915798, "o", "lease    26c9557b-1cd9-4583-b16b-49239d66169b\r\nactive   no\r\nparent   d008b924-8311-499e-a2a5-d4ee52a749e3\r\nexpires  2026-11-05T19:32:04.04278Z\r\nrevoked  2026-11-05T19:27:04.100674Z (agent session compromised)\r\n"]
[1.915999, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1m== 8. The coder's next call, even the legitimate one, is denied: the revocation cascaded\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[1.916025, "o", "$ ATTENUO_TOKEN=\"$CODER\" attenuo call --server github --tool read_file --arg repo=alice/public-docs --arg path=README.md\r\n"]
[1.924133, "o", "DENIED  lease_revoked\r\ndecision 31ee9b71-8e72-4b31-a079-f5f09558206b\r\n"]
[1.924437, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1m== 9. The audit log records every decision, and its hash chain checks out\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[1.924453, "o", "$ attenuo audit tail -n 10\r\n"]
[1.934152, "o", "#1    2026-11-05T19:27:04.024864Z  ALLOW attenuo/token.root  assistant for alice  reason=token_issued  id=f48c82f3-d57b-4cbd-8d2c-f2f42f81d761\r\n#2    2026-11-05T19:27:04.024864Z  ALLOW attenuo/admin.root_token  by urn:attenuo:admin  reason=admin_action  id=84e5d0ce-22cf-47ef-949e-f8696fb74527\r\n#3    2026-11-05T19:27:04.04278Z  ALLOW attenuo/token.exchange  assistant > coder for alice  reason=token_issued  id=31788897-b071-401e-afa5-0a5dc45a8f2a\r\n#4    2026-11-05T19:27:04.069507Z  ALLOW github/read_file  assistant > coder for alice  reason=policy_allow  id=045d4618-e80c-493b-b632-47e2b8ac1920\r\n#5    2026-11-05T19:27:04.073565Z  tool_result  github/read_file  assistant > coder for alice  decision=045d4618-e80c-493b-b632-47e2b8ac1920  label=untrusted size=149  id=ceedc62f-1a80-45e6-a53d-f2883eb18c0d\r\n#6    2026-11-05T19:27:04.082599Z  DENY  github/read_file  assistant > coder for alice  reason=policy_deny  id=90c719e5-338c-4435-b418-722a4b5d64c5\r\n#7    2026-11-05T19:27:04.091598Z  DENY  github/create_issue  assi"]
[1.934156, "o", "stant > coder for alice  reason=capability_denied  id=10fd48a8-f559-4b52-a212-89dba8f02d0a\r\n"]
[1.934171, "o", "#8    2026-11-05T19:27:04.100674Z  ALLOW attenuo/admin.lease.revoke  by urn:attenuo:admin  reason=admin_action  id=de7166ae-ef72-4fe4-bd4b-ae2a9512fd70\r\n#9    2026-11-05T19:27:04.117444Z  DENY  github/read_file  assistant > coder for alice  reason=lease_revoked  id=31ee9b71-8e72-4b31-a079-f5f09558206b\r\n"]
[1.934376, "o", "$ attenuo audit verify\r\n"]
[1.942734, "o", "audit chain OK: 9 entries verified\r\ncheckpoints: none signed yet\r\n"]
[1.942894, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1m== What reached the GitHub server\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[1.946666, "o", "  fake-mcp: tools/call read_file {\"path\":\"README.md\",\"repo\":\"alice/public-docs\"}\r\n"]
[1.946818, "o", "  -> 1 tools/call reached upstream. The three denied calls never left attenuo.\r\n"]
[1.950463, "x", "0"]
